s://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Hud\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/11.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 98\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/11-98.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/11.html\">Sûre Hud</a> › Âyet 98</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Hud 11:98</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿يَقْدُمُ قَوْمَهُ يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ فَأَوْرَدَهُمُ النَّارَ وَبِئْسَ الْوِرْدُ الْمَوْرُودُ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Firavun, kıyamet gününde kavminin önüne geçecek ve onları ateşe götürecektir. Ne kötü varış yeridir orası!</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر أنه يقدم قومه ولم يقل يسوقهم وأنه أوردهم النار. ومعلوم أن المتقدم إذا أورد المتأخرين النار: كان هو أول من يردها وإلا لم يكن قادما؛ بل كان سائقا؛<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 2/283</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s11a98\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/11-88.html\">Önceki âyet (11:88)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/11-101.html\">Sonraki âyet (11:101)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}